        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions 4 Inch \"C\" Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis sleek 4\" high pull  is great for  cabinets and drawers. Use in your kitchen, bathroom, or closets. It may also used on armoires and other furniture. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>This \"C\" Door Pull is available in other sizes and finishes, <a href=\"/pages/contact\"><b>Contact Us</a></b> for more information.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nImpeccably hand crafted from high grade 3/8\" thick non rusting aluminum in your choice of 3 high quality, long lasting finish choices.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/C4x2-pull-size.jpg?v=1704442269\" width=\"300\" height=\"425\" border=\"0\" alt=\"First Impressions 4 x 2 C door pulls dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> of First Impressions \"C\" Door Pull\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Holes: 3-1/4\" Center to Center</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\nNote: This C door handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Sizes</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold individually (1 door pull).</b>\r\n</p>",
